.TH MARBOR\-ANALYTICS 1 "2026-08-17" "marbor dev" "Marbor Manual"
.SH NAME
marbor\-analytics \- hourly analytics + per\-model stats (P\-A2-07)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B marbor analytics
[action] [args] [\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
hourly analytics + per\-model stats (P\-A2-07)
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B show
show analytics (raw JSON)
.TP
.B export
export analytics to a local file
.RS
.TP
.B \-\-type string
hourly (default) or models
.TP
.B \-\-format string
csv or json (default json)
.TP
.B \-\-output string
local file path to save to (default: server\-suggested filename)
.RE
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-server
Admin API base URL (default "http://localhost:8080", env MARBOR_SERVER)
.TP
.B \-\-json
output machine\-readable JSON instead of a human table
.TP
.B \-\-username
admin username, used to log in (env MARBOR_USERNAME)
.TP
.B \-\-password
admin password, used to log in (env MARBOR_PASSWORD)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmarbor\fR(1)
